{"reviewId": "373155740_82p3NfXT5", "review": {"abstract": "也就是说，微观主体已经无法对货币的宽松和持续宽松做出理性的反应，因为在这个阶段，不断下滑的总需求制约了微观主体的行为，他们更加注重经济基本面和未来的预期，而对流动性宽松程度的反应事实上已经下降了。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "1. 实体经济“吃不下”更多的钱\n\n长波衰退之后，经济已经很疲软，即使央行拼命放水（降息、印钱），企业和个人也没办法有效利用这些钱去投资、生产或消费。\n\n就像胃口已经很小的人，你再端来更多菜，他也吃不下。\n\n\n\n2. 人们对“放水”反应变钝\n\n在经济好的时候，降息放钱，大家会马上去贷款、投资、消费。\n\n但在这个阶段，大家更关心经济前景是否好转，而不是钱多不多。\n\n\n\n3. 总需求不足是核心问题\n\n“总需求下滑”意味着市场上买东西、投资、建厂的需求都下降了。\n\n这让企业更谨慎，个人也更保守，所以即使钱便宜，也没人愿意冒险扩张。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "921-1019", "createTime": 1755187556, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "373155740_82p3NfXT5", "userVid": 373155740, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 11, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 373155740, "name": "zzz", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIW0YMGLv1JtzxwqibXibJQj79kLicQoxwC0bibm3Lbb5WpFDMuOSxXeyGMhNsYtO9LVrr1iaib3T9oJzYRfUHfibtQAOXs95IRbtWTEPsXPMUC4j9dQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 45, "likes": [{"userVid": 23713396, "name": "薰衣草的小乐园", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0031-VCCeANalWzKbZWQCjE7UHe7/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "